title: F5OS Fan Speed
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/network/f5
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors the speed in RPM of each fan in the fan tray of an F5 Networks rSeries
 appliance running F5OS. Alerts when a fan speed drops below a lower threshold,
 indicating a stalled or failed fan.

discovery:
 One service is created per fan (Fan 1 through Fan 8 on the r5800 model).
